  m_text: 'Hydrogen-1(Protium) is the most common Isotope of Hydrogen in the world.
    It has an Atomic weight of 1, containing a single Proton and a single electron
    orbit.


    Bring this atom near another Hydrogen or a Deuternium model to fuse
    them'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
